{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>灣仔對開海面有野豬出沒暢泳。（Threads「unknowndelete_aki」截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>灣仔對開海面有野豬出沒暢泳！ 社交平台流傳兩段影片，從影片中可見，晚上時分，一隻野豬於灣仔海濱活動空間對開的海中暢泳，悠然自得。拍攝者見狀驚訝問道「點解你會落咗去嘅？你想游水都唔使咁嘅！」更笑稱牠是「海豬」。影片未有交代拍攝時間，亦未能得知野豬如何落海，以及最後有否自行返回岸上。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:22:36.807248+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:44:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:17:58.619991+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:17:58.619991+00:00","content_hash":"1bf41043369204d9ca18066b956023ae6325cea8ca271f82a5fe4ff3cd98bcc0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}